// JES-012 battle_ballad: 아군 명중 제거(명중은 중보병 지휘 몫), 치명타 4/5/6/7/8%, 속도 바닐라 2/2/3/3/4. 지휘와 버프 축 분리 [제작자]
// JES-002 [trace 2026-10-05] Reduce dominant team speed and critical bonuses while retaining accuracy and Finale preparation.
// JES-002 Battle Ballad team speed 1/1/2/2/3 and critical bonus 1/2/3/4/5%; accuracy and Finale-specific preparation retained.
// JES-002 [intent 2026-10-06] High-speed Jester plus party speed can dominate initiative and suppress enemy stress actions; reduce speed to preserve turn-order choices.
// JES-002 [intent 2026-10-06] Critical bonuses also trigger class critical benefits and stress recovery; combined with Inspiring Tune this can over-supply party stress management.
